Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 12:09:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 20/42] feat(amdgpu): complete generic dispatch control
 lifecycle

Advertise bit 8 only with owner-bound MAP/ALLOC/H2D/SUBMIT/type20/UNMAP; separate logical ABI alignment from backing-page alignment; preserve durable ACK/completion ordering and disconnect cleanup. This is native admission/retire only and makes no GPU execution claim.

